{"name": "Batelus", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Real opponents, async turns. Try to win 12 battle before losing all your health.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/a4604a6f31c61ec6344e6345136eb3a0.poster.avif?t=1792266606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/a4604a6f31c61ec6344e6345136eb3a0.webm?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/a4604a6f31c61ec6344e6345136eb3a0.mp4?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Army</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Army creation is pretty straightforward and no luck involved. You need to build your army around what you are offered.\u00a0Good positioning beats a larger force.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tactics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your placement on the map matters too, since where your unit will enter into combat on the map can change the fate of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5f6e140a5d2584bfb1d1ffa60f673ab8.poster.avif?t=1792266606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5f6e140a5d2584bfb1d1ffa60f673ab8.webm?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5f6e140a5d2584bfb1d1ffa60f673ab8.mp4?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Essences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Essences are your main loots, what give you control over your armies, stats and map. You need to play around them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5e3df75f67948922580cf3bdef2fe277.poster.avif?t=1792266606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5e3df75f67948922580cf3bdef2fe277.webm?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/5e3df75f67948922580cf3bdef2fe277.mp4?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Lands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lands are what makes the map. All lands affect the units on them differently, and they drop different essences so they will affect your whole run with drops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/2096322fe07ba781f66fc8b3fb4f9d22.poster.avif?t=1792266606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/2096322fe07ba781f66fc8b3fb4f9d22.webm?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/2096322fe07ba781f66fc8b3fb4f9d22.mp4?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Units are creatures created with simple recipes, they can be specialized only using the essences, spells and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/bce18d428660d2e6e23ce04cf8d3d945.poster.avif?t=1792266606\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/bce18d428660d2e6e23ce04cf8d3d945.webm?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/extras/bce18d428660d2e6e23ce04cf8d3d945.mp4?t=1792266606\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spells are offers made by gods for you to fit into your builds. They can be equipped by all the unit races, and they can have synergies with essence souls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Auto battler where you build not only an army, but also a map! Use what is given by the gods, and win. Battles. Armies. Tactics. Elements. Lands. Units. Spells.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4277100/0c116a36fe586a7068657e17b708c4436f5dceca/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1792266606", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Auto Battler", "Strategy", "PvP", "Asynchronous Multiplayer", "Stylized", "Fantasy"], "developers": "Botan", "publishers": "Botan", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4277100", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/aE7WtdiU5oE", "first_seen": 1792188000.0, "review_rank": 34}